    <li>Your history with someone <span class=\"n\">4</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 304\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"114\"/>\n      <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"190\"/>\n      <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"266\"/>\n      <line class=\"a\" x1=\"4\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"38\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"rr\">\n      <div class=\"yr r\">2023</div>\n      <ol>\n        <li class=\"hi\"><span class=\"n\">1</span> Your activity</li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">2</span> Information about the post</li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">3</span> Information about the person who posted</li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">4</span> Your history with someone</li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"cap\">Feed and Stories shared one order in 2021. The 2023 order is for Feed alone.</p>\n</div>\n"
